  "description": "Variation of Condition 2 (operating hours) of planning permission ref. 2012/1273, dated 31 January 2013. The proposed variation seeks to amend the permitted operating hours to allow the business to operate 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Hoxton East and Shoreditch Ward",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-18T11:15:07.627Z",
  "street_name": "OLD STREET",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The proposed unrestricted 24-hour operation of the premises, seven days a week, would give rise to an increased potential for noise and disturbance arising from customer movements and delivery-related activity during the overnight period. In the absence of sufficient information demonstrating that these impacts could be adequately mitigated, the proposal would result in significant adverse impacts to the amenities of neighbouring residential occupiers and is therefore contrary to policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) and policy D14 (Noise) of the London Plan (2021).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
